        citation: 'Cheung, G. K., Zimmermann, T., & Nagappan, N. (2014). The first hour experience: How the initial play can engage (or lose) new players. Proceedings of the First ACM SIGCHI Annual Symposium on Computer-Human Interaction in Play, 57–66.',
        url: 'https://doi.org/10.1145/2658537.2658540',
