          'The study was qualitative, built on what players chose to write about, so it maps the kinds of attachment rather than measuring how common each is. Its value is in the range. Attachment is not one dial that turns up with more dialogue or better graphics. A small, simple character can earn admiration by being good at something, affection by being reliably pleasant company, or care by seeming a little vulnerable.',
